IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sfa-core`
IMPORT `sfac-duties`

-- Tests for sfac-duties.l4: three traces for each rule, written from the text (the time limit is the number of days the text gives): done on the last day (FULFILLED), done two days late (BREACH), not done by the end of the trace (RESIDUAL).
-- The outcome of each trace is compared on both stable builds by work/traces.py.

§ `s 241(10): the duty as a rule`
-- EXPECT FULFILLED: done on day 7, the last day
#TRACE (`s 241(10) the person making the offer must pay the applicant within 7 days from the receipt of the notification` (`An offeror` "Acme Pte Ltd")) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (`An offeror` "Acme Pte Ltd") DOES `s 241(10) pay the applicant all moneys paid on account of the application` AT 7
-- EXPECT BREACH: done on day 9, two days late
#TRACE (`s 241(10) the person making the offer must pay the applicant within 7 days from the receipt of the notification` (`An offeror` "Acme Pte Ltd")) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (`An offeror` "Acme Pte Ltd") DOES `s 241(10) pay the applicant all moneys paid on account of the application` AT 9
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL: nothing is done in the trace
#TRACE (`s 241(10) the person making the offer must pay the applicant within 7 days from the receipt of the notification` (`An offeror` "Acme Pte Ltd")) AT 0 WITH

